msgstr "Vänster: **Baslager**. Mitten: **Blandningslager**. Höger: **Rest**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/modulo.rst:72
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/modulo.rst:76
msgid "Modulo - Continuous"
msgstr "Rest - kontinuerlig"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/modulo.rst:80
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Modulo - Continuous\" in English."
msgstr "Blandningsläget kallas \"Modulo - Continuous\" på engelska."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/modulo.rst:82
#| msgid ""
#| "Performs a modulo calculation using the sum of blend layer and the "
#| "minimum possible value after zero. As this is a continuous mode, anything "
#| "between odd to even numbers are inverted."
msgid ""
"Performs a modulo calculation using the sum of the blend layer and the "
"minimum possible value after zero. As this is a continuous mode, anything "
"between odd to even numbers are inverted."
msgstr ""
"Utför en restberäkning med användning av summan av blandningslagret och det "
"minsta möjliga värdet efter noll. Eftersom det är ett kontinuerligt läge,  "
"inverteras allt mellan udda och jämna tal."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/modulo.rst:87
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/modulo/"
"Blending_modes_Modulo_Continuous_Gradient_Comparison.png"
msgstr ""
